WEBVTT

00:06:27.669 --> 00:06:30.288
Algunhas son moi obvias.

00:06:30.572 --> 00:06:31.573
(Respiración)

00:06:32.223 --> 00:06:33.441
Cousas como…

00:06:34.809 --> 00:06:35.961
cotonetes…

00:06:36.478 --> 00:06:37.562
e…

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.231
algodóns.

00:06:41.366 --> 00:06:45.103
(Vídeo) Paris ASMR: Merquei
un saboroso té de París.

00:06:46.755 --> 00:06:48.156
Para ti, si.

00:06:50.208 --> 00:06:55.397
Chámase “Weekend à Paris”,

00:06:56.915 --> 00:06:58.850
“Fin de semana en París”